      "body": "一直想找一个能在 Linux 上圆角截屏的工具，找来找去没结果，于是自己写了个简单脚本，挺好用的，分享给大家。\n项目地址：[roundshot](https://github.com/Youpen-y/roundshot)\n- 无圆角截图\n```bash\nroundshot 0\n```\n\n<img width=\"519\" height=\"468\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b2ef074-ba74-43b1-8826-5b01e05cfd23\" />\n\n\n- 圆角截图（默认 radius=10）\n```bash\nroundshot\n```\n\n<img width=\"504\" height=\"463\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/67c558d5-b969-4947-9fea-9d9df012df76\" />\n\n\n- 圆角截图（radius=100）\n```bash\nroundshot 100\n```\n\n<img width=\"516\" height=\"505\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0338b65e-f895-42c0-8c74-47d0399326b9\" />\n",
